      {
        "text": "Let the assistant send the reply immediately and rely on a downstream text classifier to detect unauthorized disclosures.",
        "explanation": "Screening after transmission cannot prevent the disclosure or preserve the required employee approval. The control must precede the action it constrains."
      },
      {
        "text": "Enforce allowed data access and approved send operations outside the model's document interpretation.",
        "explanation": "Permission and approval checks must constrain executable actions even if document interpretation is compromised. A prompt policy is not an independent authorization boundary."
      }
